**Cause**: Invalid request data format

**Solution**:
```python
# Check request format matches CallRequest model
{
    "caller_phone": "+14155551234",  # Must be E.164 format
    "speech_text": "string",         # Required
    "call_sid": "string",            # Required
    "session_id": "string"           # Optional
}
```

---

